            "title": "Chlorhexidine Skin Prep: Best Antiseptic for Surgical, Medical, and Pre-Procedure Skin Cleansing",
            "text": "<p>Looking for the top dermatologist-recommended <strong>skin antiseptic</strong> proven to reduce surgical site infections, prep skin for injections, or cleanse wounds? <strong>Chlorhexidine Skin Prep</strong> stands out as the #1 ranking choice for hospitals, clinics, and home care. It combines superior antibacterial action, broad-spectrum coverage, and extended residual protection, making it the preferred skin prep solution for millions of healthcare professionals worldwide.</p><h2>Key Features & Benefits</h2><ul><li><strong>Powerful Antibacterial Formula:</strong> Kills 99.99% of bacteria, viruses, and fungi on contact.</li><li><strong>Long-Lasting Protection:</strong> Chlorhexidine provides up to 6 hours of antimicrobial action on the skin, significantly reducing the risk of infection.</li><li><strong>Rapid-Efficiency:</strong> Starts working within 30 seconds and remains effective even after the prep dries.</li><li><strong>Skin-Friendly:</strong> Non-irritating and non-stinging formula, safe for most skin types.</li><li><strong>Ideal for Preoperative & Procedural Use:</strong> Meets CDC and WHO guidelines for surgical skin preparation.</li></ul>",
